cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these workshop materials, please cite them as below."
title: "Analyzing Behavioral Data at the Cognitive Process Level with bmm in R"
abstract: >-
  Materials for a 90-minute lunchtime workshop at the Psychonomic Society
  Annual Meeting 2026 (San Diego): slides, take-home notebooks, datasets, and
  pre-fitted models introducing signal detection theory, the Memory
  Measurement Model (M3), and the EZ-drift diffusion model with the bmm R
  package.
